## LR(A的左孩子的右子树插入结点)代码实现



若 A 的左孩子节点 B 的右子树 E 插入节点 F ，导致节点 A 失衡，如图：

![image-20210410204030943](https://simon-blog-bucket.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%8C%E5%8F%89%E6%A0%91/image-20210410204030943.png)

旋转流程如下：

![image-20210410204728820](https://simon-blog-bucket.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%8C%E5%8F%89%E6%A0%91/image-20210410204728820.png)

![image-20210410204740726](https://simon-blog-bucket.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%B8%8E%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%8C%E5%8F%89%E6%A0%91/image-20210410204740726.png)

也就是说，经过这两步操作，使得原来根节点的左孩子的右孩子 E 节点成为了新的根节点



```java
/**
* LR型 右旋转之后再左旋
* 结点如上图对应
**/
private Node LR_rotate(Node A) {
    Node E = RR_rotate(A.leftChild);

    return LL_rotate(E);
}
```



