## 优先级队列



* 在控制台设置队列优先级

  ![image-20240418000906891](https://simon-blog-bucket.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E4%BB%B6/%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E9%98%9F%E5%88%97/RabbitMQ%20%E4%BB%8E%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98/image-20240418000906891.png)

* 队列代码中添加优先级

  ```JAVA
  Map<String, Object> params = new HashMap();
  params.put("x-max-priority", 10);
  channel.queueDeclare("hello", true, false, false, params);
  ```

* 消息代码中添加优先级

  ```JAVA
  AMQP.BasicProperties properties = new AMQP.BasicProperties().builder().priority(10).build();
  ```



