**引入依赖**

```XML
<dependencies>
    <!--rabbitmq 依赖客户端-->
    <dependency>
        <groupId>com.rabbitmq</groupId>
        <artifactId>amqp-client</artifactId>
        <version>5.8.0</version>
    </dependency>
